aint 4.\nBefore returning the plan, check every name, line number and claim about behaviour against the files you read, and remove any you did not see.","occurredAt":"2026-11-11T17:51:40.990Z","attribution":{"roleId":null,"actorId":"founder","actualModel":"n/a (human Founder decision)","executionSurface":"founder-terminal"}},"committed_at":"2026-11-11T17:51:40.965Z"}],"rejections":[]}